# Ollama Configuration
# =====================
# URL to your Ollama instance
# For local development: http://localhost:11434
# For production: Use your hosted Ollama URL (e.g., https://ollama.yourdomain.com)
OLLAMA_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434
# Optional: API Key for custom Python API
OLLAMA_API_KEY=

# Note: In production, you'll need to deploy Ollama on a server
# or use a cloud-hosted Ollama instance that your Vercel deployment can access.

